{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0253_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0253_1000_p", "source_sha256": "65daeef662a938e5460ba29ea373dcf559f7b0ff0c9ea9c89aa43ba1f0e6283f", "ja": "（クリスマス当日にイベントのお仕事……。\n美希にはちょっと、悪いことしちゃったかな）", "zh": "（圣诞节当天还要来做活动的工作……是不是让美希有点难过了）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0253_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0253_1001_003mik", "source_sha256": "b1f6b0f49faacc54ee1938ca60e5e4afb449d385ee9f35adbf2d4eba2f2e5414", "ja": "{$P$}、着替え終わったの。\nお仕事、もう終わりだよね？", "zh": "{$P$}，我换好衣服了。\n工作已经结束了吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0253_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0253_1002_p", "source_sha256": "b0f50a7fdeafbb84efa017bae69fc9b09eb27434beded6d8c6399c0869f08259", "ja": "ああ。お疲れさま、美希。\nそれと……今日はゴメンな。", "zh": "是啊。辛苦了，美希。\n还有……今天对不起了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0253_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0253_1003_003mik", "source_sha256": "09d91f2b86ffbb256a9e49621fba673fb3e3a9e55ff0bb3963804ec2c7131730", "ja": "え？　どうしたの、{$P$}？\nミキ、べつに何もされてないよ？", "zh": "咦？怎么了，{$P$}？\n美希又没被做什么啊？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0253_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0253_1004_p", "source_sha256": "a143a4fd2102dd7bb3c9f1c4907afef2998764e0aa3870d1a5e1be17396d0eda", "ja": "いや、だって、さすがにクリスマスだから……。\n予定とか、あったんじゃないか？", "zh": "不，可是，毕竟是圣诞节啊……\n你难道没有什么安排吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0253_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0253_1005_003mik", "source_sha256": "72c5969abe1a5ea7d2c6cb190a087d321d4567b4eb5a1ad7bf43821ee55c341d", "ja": "ううん、全然そんなことないの。\nミキ、今日がお仕事でよかったって思ってるよ♪", "zh": "没有，完全没有那回事哦。\n美希觉得今天能有工作真是太好啦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0253_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0253_1006_p", "source_sha256": "edcfbf61fd095b39322965b527fbd7ebe37ccca485c76f09b4e520a1754dc72f", "ja": "えっ！？　美希がそんなにやる気を……？", "zh": "咦！？美希居然这么有干劲……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0253_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0253_1007_003mik", "source_sha256": "e90d01ff3e2600526e6104682b16413b9c3cf581eb0178f4eeb929b83eb50ad5", "ja": "だって、お仕事のおかげで、\n今日は一日、ハニーと一緒にいられたから！", "zh": "因为多亏了工作，\n今天一整天都能和亲爱的在一起嘛！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0253_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0253_1008_003mik", "source_sha256": "5f1cda1fcb1a148e5e042db7daa7cf45a3ee831f5c3b45514bd13ff5823d0e88", "ja": "クリスマスにハニーがいないなんて、\nありえないの！　だから、オッケーってカンジ♪", "zh": "圣诞节怎么能没有亲爱的呢，\n那是不可能的！所以，感觉完全没问题♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0253_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0253_1009_p", "source_sha256": "6924805f73d8f95ae6c519aa51b0e76e8bcc66941958afc87614bf027cf820ce", "ja": "美希……。", "zh": "美希……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0253_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0253_1010_003mik", "source_sha256": "240b93313bb8a2bc00c78437bf1237fca34bba8e51f3688d3ab93d30d48cf007", "ja": "あっ、でも～……やっぱり今のウソ！\nミキ、気にしてるの！　すごく怒ってるの！", "zh": "啊，不过～……刚才那句话果然是骗人的！\n美希很在意！真的特别生气！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0253_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0253_1011_p", "source_sha256": "8f3b643452cdb395d919f59597f5aabed0b4053e74221f49a3ba58fee482d462", "ja": "美希！？", "zh": "美希！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0253_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0253_1012_003mik", "source_sha256": "d89a935cc4551b6536d7d1b149afd9cbb9835bd851dadf74695b2857e037e7bf", "ja": "ゴメンって言葉だけじゃなくて、\nちゃんとセイイを見せてくれないと、ヤ！", "zh": "光说“对不起”可不行，得好好拿出诚意来才行，不行！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0253_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0253_1013_003mik", "source_sha256": "82f85556578da7feb89ab6c0800987ea9ce0c66e812b7781e1dfdb29a695825b", "ja": "だから……今から、一緒にディナーに行くの！\nそうしたら、特別に許してあげてもいいよ。", "zh": "所以……现在就陪我一起去吃晚餐！\n这样的话，我也可以特别原谅你哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0253_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0253_1014_p", "source_sha256": "f81998338043042ac7c623bcd8b7663685f821d95f39d36beb2cf10f2b4cbc55", "ja": "……なるほど。\nでも、今からだと遅くなっちゃうしなぁ。", "zh": "……原来如此。\n不过，现在去的话时间太晚了啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0253_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0253_1015_003mik", "source_sha256": "fe9576429a4617f1560a205e824e7b8466d38026647ca4103f6c4acc78f31daf", "ja": "むー。せっかくのクリスマスなのに……。\nミキ、色々、楽しいことしようと思ってたのに。", "zh": "唔……难得是圣诞节……\n美希还想着要做各种开心的事呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0253_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0253_1016_p", "source_sha256": "d2d51f41701d15df034c5ffdf7e827cb58edc1db6212771440da9f6168d84f91", "ja": "さっきと言ってる事が……いや。\n仕方ない、わかったよ。今日だけ特別だからな？", "zh": "刚才说的明明……算了。\n真拿你没办法，知道了。今天就特别允许你这样哦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0253_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0253_1017_003mik", "source_sha256": "17bdaf9ccb4dd7be8e215fe0aa288b86df7e1d51adc0facfcdf2cc3d7a6b437d", "ja": "わぁ、やったーなの！\nハニー、大好きだよ？　あはっ☆", "zh": "哇，太好了！亲爱的，我最喜欢你了哦？啊哈☆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0253_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0253_1018_003mik", "source_sha256": "d50d230315bd7fc713eaf9555b3844e90782a080e47d127bf89538add4656e83", "ja": "ほらほら、早く行こ！　時間がもったいないの♪\nケーキ食べて、夜景も見て……色んなコトしなきゃ！", "zh": "快快，赶紧走吧！可不能浪费时间哦♪\n吃蛋糕、看夜景……还有好多事情要做呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0253_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0253_1019_p", "source_sha256": "9dca3e31f4b9ecb9711e198918d592e4ce272f39c262deae37ad3ed1618e02e8", "ja": "えっ、美希？　今ディナーだけって……。\nおーい！？", "zh": "诶，美希？你刚才不是说只吃晚餐吗……\n喂——！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
